{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fe9905178f7ab8b9733b5b09a44c3ffed39767c14ebab1cdb8b01e8d751d0b7",
      "text": "这个嘛……我之所以珍视“大家”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0489f1976a89147a4683e795508b261e32d4500e79ef00f8a80e8ac7bd5737",
      "text": "……这或许意味着，我并没有真正去\n理解对方呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9142d4d83d43858292160e5e3696816410728a1d3034bb92c43c81cb9b75912a",
      "text": "我并不觉得这是坏事哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:032884356dce1f12bf9b33357207cb0aa805229989c55bd10c5a42d2421e62eb",
      "text": "因为去理解、试图去理解对方，\n有时反而会产生问题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284511b300136b74a7ab988c8598b236e48ff0e5fb1856e4c0e6cc19ce7a168e",
      "text": "以为心意相通结果只是误会，\n想要去贴近却遭到了拒绝……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a1951d86e7ca2abbaf3e52839a6e4474a6c11d0ddfac1460f2ed0cbfab2147",
      "text": "（……即使长久陪伴在身边，\n有时也会在一无所知的情况下面临离别）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11438484ea317b5ba03a633cb6858b9b5dcae67c76fa3f285f8856c11f045a9a",
      "text": "即使如此，换作渡边先生的话……\n还是会想要真正去理解别人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b134bd44bc9b1a00a6fd3703af1b78a09b00f06f25000d563338f3dc766d011",
      "text": "那个嘛……\n如果你希望我去理解的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdb70a974bcb9778b521f1060c4d24628e3f1cf4dcde9966c1b89470ebcb7110",
      "text": "那么，我大概会想要尝试去理解吧。\n所以，我想听听北斗先生是怎么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:067f5ff1c7d80f7eb1d11ce1c6bd27ad11fb0adc7b1b8170da1957ca6f8c05d3",
      "text": "……\n呵呵，真是赢不过渡边先生啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2213efe2e277a5b6189b3524abeb31ad74e868f02915d7b67ee3c3a65d31726e",
      "text": "是很刁钻的问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b91ed254d86bfe1cf4cc95178157f64426716980be598bc10c64927941c339d",
      "text": "是啊，有一点。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641ffae9892d34b16ec14e377148fa297551ed6eeff689111fcb919283432b2b",
      "text": "自己到底想怎么做……我想在这里，\n多多发掘出那样的热情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:974fd228790346c1d815f3e0cf80fd1d91884e63becb67a8ec3070ca38f75e59",
      "text": "无论多少次、无论有多少都能找到的。\n因为315 Pro就是这样的地方啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7e52c366c363fda5a46db10c90977d4dbb98f0bea010be2bb52d5525126284a",
      "text": "是啊。\n毕竟这里有许多像您这样出色的大人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
